   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1.4. Increased capacity of Member States to improve social dialogue and labour relations laws, processes and institutions</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Government and social partners adopted a roadmap to strengthen their collective dispute resolution. For example, by consolidating the commissions for the resolution of collective disputes which were previously stablished on an ad hoc bases into one simple national body (medium term objective) ILO facilitated a self-assessment of collective dispute resolution system with the tripartite working group on dispute resolution and assisted in drafting and validating a roadmap for the strengthening of the system with the Government and social partners.</narrative>
   </description>
